# Phase Lindsay L.5b — SI-03 site stat-name allowlist.
#
# The grep test at `tests/site_stat_name_grep.rs` scans rendered HTML
# output for canonical stat names like "Goals", "Points", etc. Hits
# outside this allowlist trip the test, forcing the contributor to
# either route the stat name through `StatId::label()` / `short_label()`
# or add an explicit entry here.
#
# Format: one regex pattern per line, lines starting with `#` are
# comments. Patterns match against the rendered HTML; ANY occurrence
# elsewhere fails the test.
#
# When you add an entry here:
#   1. Justify in a comment WHY this string can't come from StatId.
#   2. Include enough context (e.g. the surrounding HTML class) so a
#      future reader can validate the entry is still earned.
#
# Initial allowlist is empty — the L.5b sweep starts from a clean
# baseline. Future hardcoded additions either route through the
# catalog or earn an explicit entry here with a stated reason.
